    "https://www.carlow.edu/about/quick-facts/career-outcomes/": {
      "title": "Career Outcomes",
      "description": "Career Outcomes - 98% of Graduates Get a Job - Carlow University Please note: This website includes an accessibility system. Press Control-F11 to adjust the website to people with visual disabilities who are using a screen reader; Press Control-F10 to open an accessibility menu. Popup heading Close Accessibility Press enter for Accessibility for blind people who use screen readers Press enter for Keyboard Navigation Press enter for Accessibility menu Skip to content Request Info Visit Stay Curious Support Carlow Apply Now Start Application Check Status Submit Deposit What is a Celtic? Search Menu Close × Academic Programs View all programs Healing Expression Discovery Transformation Service Leadership Workforce Development Apply Now Start Application Check Status Submit Deposit What is a Celtic? We CU Our Mission Leadership Alumni Support Carlow News Events Stay Curious Student Login Employee Login Career Outcomes Carlow University graduates enter the workforce with a drive to serve with mercy and compassion, making them top candidates for businesses in all industries. The University’s Career Outcomes Report is an annual summary of post-graduation employment data that shows where our alumni excel professionally. Information in this report was obtained from individual graduates responding to Carlow University’s First Destination Survey for graduation dates August 2023 through May 2024. Additional relevant data was gathered through online sources, fellow graduates, employers, and faculty. This method of reporting career outcome data is in compliance with the national reporting guidelines established by the National Association of Colleges and Employers (NACE). Carlow University made good faith efforts to verify the information obtained by any source other than the responding graduates. Definition of terms and further information can be found in our full report . Career outcomes: All degrees 97% Overall career outcome rate 89% Graduates completing at least one PWE (Professional Work Experience) $57, 954 average full-time salary Top employers University of Pittsburgh Medical Center (UPMC) Allegheny Intermediate Unit Fox Chapel Area School District VA Healthcare Systems Deaf and Hard of Hearing Services Center, Inc CVS Health Allegheny County Health Department Cleveland Clinic East Liberty Family Healthcare Center Allegheny Health Network Wesley Family Services Bon Secours Mercy Health Center for Social Innovation Progressive Medical Specialists Children’s Healthcare of Atlanta Massachusetts General Hospital Pittsburgh Penguins Cleveland Clinic Center for Justice Innovation Carlow University University of Pittsburgh The Wolf Group, PA Fresenius Medical Care North America North Allegheny School District St. Clair Health Andy Warhol Museum BNY Mellon PA Center for Change Representative Continuing Education Programs Carlow University Lake Erie College of Osteopathic Medicine Loma Linda University University of Pittsburgh Pittsburg State University Liberty University Antioch University Duquesne University Bachelor degrees 95% overall career outcome rate 89% Graduates completing at least one PWE (Professional Work Experience) Masters degrees 100% overall career outcome rate 68% Graduates completing at least one PWE (Professional Work Experience) Doctorate degrees 100% overall career outcome rate 100% outcome rate for job seekers Career Outcomes full report The Carlow University Career Outcomes Report shows post-graduation employment data from a University survey as well as data from online sources, employers and faculty. Reporting is compliant with the national reporting guidelines established by National Association of Colleges and Employers (NACE). ▸ View or download the 2023-2024 Career Outcomes Report [pdf]. Past reports View or download the following reports: 2020-2021 Career Outcomes Report [pdf] 2019-2020 Career Outcomes Report [pdf] 2018-2019 Career Outcomes Report [pdf] 2017-2018 Career Outcomes Report [pdf] 2016-2017 Career Outcomes Report [pdf] Contact Career Development We’re here to help you succeed, contact us! careercenter@carlow.edu +1 (412) 578-6067 ™ Carlow University Become a Celtic Virtual Tour Request Information 3333 Fifth Avenue Pittsburgh, PA 15213 800.333.2275 questions@carlow.edu A More Merciful World Series View Map & Directions ▸ Campus Laboratory School Student Login Employee Login Alumni Athletics Press Kit Toolbox Title IX Employment Consumer Information Facebook Twitter YouTube Instagram LinkedIn TikTok Blog A More Just & Merciful World Podcast Privacy Notices Accessibility Statement Policy & Disclosure Directory A-Z Index Sitemap © Copyright 2024 Carlow University. All rights reserved. Carlow University prohibits sex discrimination in any education program or activity that it operates. Individuals may report concerns or questions to the Title IX Coordinator, Carissa Monaco at titleix@carlow.edu or 412-578-6050 . x x"
